# Onboarding UX (must follow)

- Flow UI: **Tipo → Expediente → Listo**. Docs-first after kind; no separate “Verificar” step.
- Expediente = **one screen**: upload zone + template checklist + template fields.
- Mock upload may simulate ZIP; recognition ~2s with status on the upload control.
- Fields stay **editable during recognition**. Never lock/disable form fields for agent/LLM.
- Empty field + LLM value → autofill. Operator value ≠ LLM → warning + “Usar valor del LLM” (do not overwrite).
- SoT: `docs/ux/UX_PATTERNS.md`, `docs/ux/UXDR-001_*`, `docs/ux/UXDR-002_*`.
